{"role":"assistant","content":"好的，我看到了工作区的情况。让我先检查一下必要的工具链：\n\n- Node.js v24.15.0 ✅\n- npm 11.12.1 ✅\n- VS Code 1.122.1 ✅\n\n有一个 `resonix-agent`（类似于 Reasonix 的本地 AI Agent）已经存在于 `AI   文件夹` 中。\n\n在开始搭建之前，我需要先确认几个关键事项：","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_XxV5HsdlA1UeEXwEhQpM6983","type":"function","function":{"name":"ask_choice","arguments":"{\"question\": \"VS Code 插件项目放在哪里？你的要求是 \\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\27063\\\\Desktop\\\\工具箱\\\\AI   文件夹\\\"，但当前工作区根目录似乎就是桌面工具箱目录，而 AI   文件夹下已有 .venv/.vscode/resonix-agent 等内容。插件项目应该放在哪里？\", \"options\": [{\"id\": \"subdir\", \"title\": \"在 AI   文件夹下新建 mind-extension 子目录\", \"summary\": \"放在 /AI   文件夹/mind-extension/\"}, {\"id\": \"sibling\", \"title\": \"放在 AI   文件夹同级，新建 mind-extension 目录\", \"summary\": \"放在 /mind-extension/\"}, {\"id\": \"custom\", \"title\": \"我自己指定一个路径\", \"summary\": \"你告诉我确切路径\"}]}"}}],"reasoning_content":"So this is \"Resonix Super Agent\" - a local AI agent setup that uses MCP servers and has skills. It's similar to but not exactly the same as Reasonix (the tool I'm running as). Let me check where VS Code extensions are typically stored and understand the environment better.\n\nThe user wants:\n1. A VS Code extension for `.mind` files at `C:\\Users\\27063\\Desktop\\工具箱\\AI   文件夹`\n2. Communication with Reasonix/Resonix as backend\n\nGiven the complexity, let me first check if `yo` (Yeoman) and `vsce` (VS Code Extension Manager) are available for scaffolding, or if I should build from scratch.\n\nLet me now create a plan. This is a massive project:\n1. Scaffold VS Code extension project\n2. Create TextMate grammar for `.mind` language\n3. Create language configuration (comments, brackets, indentation)\n4. Create the main extension with:\n   - Semantic token provider\n   - Diagnostic provider\n   - Indentation lines decorator\n   - Hover highlighting provider\n   - Reasonix client for analysis\n   - Settings configuration\n5. Package and document\n\nLet me ask the user first about some decisions before proceeding. Actually,