{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_01_QBecFLngDiGVcmvT3A3Y0396","name":"read_file","content":"#!/usr/bin/env node\n\n/**\n * Resonix Super Agent - 主入口\n * 交互式命令行 Agent\n */\n\nimport { ResonixAgent } from './agent.js';\nimport chalk from 'chalk';\nimport readline from 'readline';\n\nconst rl = readline.createInterface({\n  input: process.stdin,\n  output: process.stdout\n});\n\nfunction printBanner() {\n  console.log('');\n  console.log(chalk.cyan('  ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗'));\n  console.log(chalk.cyan('  ║') + chalk.bold.white('       R E S O N I X   A G E N T        ') + chalk.cyan('║'));\n  console.log(chalk.cyan('  ║') + chalk.gray('     Professional AI Agent with MCP       ') + chalk.cyan('║'));\n  console.log(chalk.cyan('  ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝'));\n  console.log('');\n  console.log(chalk.gray('  命令:'));\n  console.log(chalk.gray('    /status   - 查看 MCP 服务器状态'));\n  console.log(chalk.gray('    /memory   - 查看记忆统计'));\n  console.log(chalk.gray('    /skills   - 查看可用技能'));\n  console.log(chalk.gray('    /clear    - 清除对话历史'));\n  console.log(chalk.gray('    /help     - 显示帮助'));\n  console.log(chalk.gray('    /exit     - 退出 Agent'));\n  console.log('');\n}\n\nasync function main() {\n  printBanner();\n\n  const agent = new ResonixAgent({\n    name: 'Resonix',\n    model: process.env.OPENAI_MODEL || 'gpt-4o'\n  });\n\n  console.log(chalk.yellow('正在初始化 Agent...'));\n  try {\n    await agent.init();\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error(chalk.red('初始化失败: ' + error.message));\n    console.log(chalk.yellow('提示: 请检查 .env 文件中的 API Key 配置'));\n    console.log(chalk.yellow('你可以复制 .env.example 为 .env 并填入你的 API Key'));\n  }\n\n  console.log(chalk.green('\nAgent 已就绪! 输入你的问题开始对话。\n'));\n\n  const prompt = () => {\n    rl.question(chalk.bold.cyan('You> '), async (input) => {\n      const trimmed = input.trim();\n\n      if (!trimmed) {\n        prompt();\n\n[…head 60 of 159 lines — call again with range / tail for more]"}
{"role":"assistant","content":"看到配置了。resonix-agent 有 DeepSeek 配置但 Key 为空。我需要你提供几个信息：","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_3OMpBA51g75xgiKLTThg1840","type":"function","function":{"name":"ask_choice","arguments":"{\"question\": \"resonix-agent 目前是 CLI 交互式工具，需要给它加一个 HTTP 服务端口，让 VS Code 插件可以请求它分析 .mind 文件。你希望怎么处理？\", \"options\": [{\"id\":\"modify-agent\",\"title\":\"改造 resonix-agent 添加 HTTP 端口\",\"summary\":\"在现有 agent 上加一个 HTTP Server 模式（端口你指定）\"},{\"id\":\"separate-bridge\",\"title\":\"单独写一个轻量桥接服务\",\"summary\":\"在 mind-extension 旁新建 bridge-server，独立运行\"}]}"}}],"reasoning_content":"I see that the resonix-agent:\n1. Has DeepSeek API configured but the key is empty (DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=)\n2. Has OpenAI configured (but with placeholder key)\n3. Is an interactive CLI agent, not an HTTP server\n\nFor the VS Code extension to use resonix-agent as a backend, I have two options:\n1. Modify resonix-agent to add an HTTP server endpoint for `.mind` analysis\n2. Have the extension call DeepSeek API directly with the same system prompt approach\n\nSince the user chose \"resonix-agent\", I'll need to:\n1. Add an HTTP server mode to resonix-agent that accepts `.mind` content and returns analysis\n2. Or create a simple bridge service\n\nBut wait - let me also think about the practical constraints. The user's DeepSeek API key is empty in .env. They have a file `deepseek API.txt` at the root level.\n\nLet me ask the user for:\n1. The DeepSeek API key (or confirm it's in the resonix-agent .env)\n2. Their preference on how to set up the HTTP server\n\nAlso, I need to install the VS Code extension development tools (`yo`, `generator-code`, `vsce`).\n\nLet me first ask about the API key, then proceed.\n\nActually, I also see the important constraint: the user wants me to ask for addresses during installation and when unsure. Let me ask about:\n1. DeepSeek API key\n2. Whether to add HTTP server to resonix-agent or create a separate bridge"}
