{"role":"assistant","content":"好，端口 3456。现在让我先检查必要工具是否已安装，然后提交整体计划。","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_tpT1MAAvore0C2nkmOlG0212","type":"function","function":{"name":"run_command","arguments":"{\"command\": \"yo --version 2>&1 || echo \\\"yo not found\\\"\"}"}},{"id":"call_01_zHjK2b69QgMYFh44WGMf4308","type":"function","function":{"name":"run_command","arguments":"{\"command\": \"vsce --version 2>&1 || echo \\\"vsce not found\\\"\"}"}},{"id":"call_02_1pBIM1W8UHHU8NcHPOns8283","type":"function","function":{"name":"run_command","arguments":"{\"command\": \"npm list -g --depth=0 2>&1\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"OK, port 3456. Now let me create a comprehensive plan and then build everything.\n\nLet me first check what VS Code extension generator tools are available - whether `yo` and `generator-code` are installed.\n\nActually, let me just start building from scratch since we know exactly what we need. The yeoman generator often creates too much boilerplate.\n\nLet me create the plan first, then execute.\n\nHere's the full plan:\n\n### Phase 1: 安装工具\n- 安装 yo, generator-code, vsce 等 VS Code 扩展开发工具\n\n### Phase 2: 创建桥接服务 (mind-bridge)\n- package.json with express + openai SDK\n- HTTP server on port 3456\n- .mind analysis endpoint that calls DeepSeek\n- Returns formatted JSON\n\n### Phase 3: 创建 VS Code 扩展 (mind-extension)\n- package.json with extension manifest\n- TextMate grammar for .mind syntax highlighting\n- Language configuration (comments, brackets)\n- Main extension code:\n  - Language registration\n  - Reasonix client (calls bridge)\n  - Indentation line decorations\n  - Hover reference highlighting\n  - Diagnostic provider\n  - Session management\n  - Settings contributions\n\n### Phase 4: 文档\n- README with installation/usage guide\n- 操作教程\n\nLet me start with the plan submission, then execute.\n\nActually, the user said \"先安装必要工具，安装的时候向我询问地址\" and \"需要自定义的时候或者拿不准的时候就询问我\" and \"如果你写不出来这个插件做不到就算了，及时停止\".\n\nLet me first check if yo and vsce are installed."}
