emi-transparent gray background. This is a core VS Code feature called \"occurrence highlighting\" or \"reference highlighting.\"\n\nFor the entity linking, I need to:\n- Use VS Code's `DocumentHighlight` API to highlight all references to the same entity on hover\n- The AI analysis needs to return entity relationship data - which tokens refer to the same real-world entity\n\nLet me think about more vocabulary classifications:\n\nCurrent 11 → expand to maybe 15-18:\n\n1. **控制流关键字** - if/else/while/for/switch/case/return/break/continue\n2. **C语言函数调用** - `func()`, `process_data()`\n3. **Python函数定义** - `def name`\n4. **C语言函数定义** - `int main()`, `void process()`\n5. **变量声明** - `int count`, `float x`\n6. **变量引用** - 使用中的变量名\n7. **类型关键字** - int/float/void/char/double/struct/union/enum\n8. **类型自定义** - typedef/struct 定义的类型名\n9. **运算符** - + - * / = ≥ ≤ != == > <\n10. **箭头/指针** - → -> * & .\n11. **数字** - 整数/浮点数\n12. **布尔/特殊常量** - TRUE/FALSE/NULL/None/void\n13. **字符串** - \"text\"\n14. **字符** - 'c'\n15. **自然语言动词/操作** - \"Count\", \"delete\", \"add\", \"print\"\n16. **自然语言名词/描述** - \"node num\", \"total\"\n17. **注释** - # // /* */\n18. **标点** - ( ) { } [ ] , ;\n\nAnd the entity linking:\n- The AI returns entity groups: entities that refer to the same logical object\n- VS Code's `vscode.DocumentHighlight` API is used to highlight them on hover\n- Also use `vscode.ReferenceProvider` to provide reference locations\n\nLet me revise the plan with these changes.\n\nActually, I think I should just proceed with building now. The user has been refining the plan multiple times. Let me make a final concise plan that incorporates all their feedback and start building.\n\nLet me create one final plan that addresses:\n1. More vocabulary classifications (18+ types)\n2. Entity linking / reference highlighting (like VS Code's built-in feature)\n3. Full file sent for caching\n4. Minimal prompt tokens"}
