{"role":"assistant","content":"### 2.2 — .env 配置","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_pGS0ErHlNYJeDRvku3JW6610","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"/AI   文件夹/mind-bridge/.env\", \"content\": \"# ============================================================\\n# Mind Bridge — 环境变量配置\\n# ============================================================\\n\\n# DeepSeek API 密钥（必填）\\n# 从 https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys 获取\\nDEEPSEEK_API_KEY=[REDACTED_API_KEY]\\n\\n# DeepSeek API 基础地址（无需修改）\\nDEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1\\n\\n# AI 模型（默认使用缓存友好的模型）\\nDEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash\\n\\n# 桥接服务端口\\nPORT=3456\\n\\n# 请求超时时间（毫秒）\\nREQUEST_TIMEOUT=30000\\n\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"Now let me write the .env file, then the source files."}
