{"role":"assistant","content":"## Step 5: TextMate 语法定义（18种词汇分类）","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_9tzj8CkIwD3Ohdw41tv08111","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"content\": \"{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/martinring/tmlanguage/master/tmlanguage.json\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Mind\\\",\\n  \\\"scopeName\\\": \\\"source.mind\\\",\\n  \\\"fileTypes\\\": [\\\".mind\\\"],\\n  \\\"patterns\\\": [\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#comments\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#strings\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#numbers\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#keywords\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#types\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#constants\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#function-calls\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#function-definitions\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#pointers\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#operators\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#punctuation\\\" },\\n    { \\\"include\\\": \\\"#natural-language\\\" }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"repository\\\": {\\n    \\\"comments\\\": {\\n      \\\"patterns\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"comment.line.number-sign.mind\\\",\\n          \\\"match\\\": \\\"#.*$\\\",\\n          \\\"comment\\\": \\\"Python 风格 # 注释\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"comment.line.double-slash.mind\\\",\\n          \\\"match\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\/\\\\\\\\/.*$\\\",\\n          \\\"comment\\\": \\\"C 风格 // 注释\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"comment.block.mind\\\",\\n          \\\"begin\\\": \\\"/\\\\\\\\*\\\",\\n          \\\"end\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\*/\\\",\\n          \\\"comment\\\": \\\"C 风格 /* */ 块注释\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"strings\\\": {\\n      \\\"patterns\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"string.quoted.double.mind\\\",\\n          \\\"begin\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\",\\n          \\\"end\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\"\\\",\\n          \\\"beginCaptures\\\": {\\n            \\\"0\\\": { \\\"name\\\": \\\"punctuation.definition.string.begin.mind\\\" }\\n          },\\n          \\\"endCaptures\\\": {\\n            \\\"0\\\": { \\\"name\\\": \\\"punctuation.definition.string.end.mind\\\" }\\n          }\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"string.quoted.single.mind\\\",\\n          \\\"begin\\\": \\\"'\\\",\\n          \\\"end\\\": \\\"'\\\",\\n          \\\"beginCaptures\\\": {\\n            \\\"0\\\": { \\\"name\\\": \\\"punctuation.definition.string.begin.mind\\\" }\\n          },\\n          \\\"endCaptures\\\": {\\n            \\\"0\\\": { \\\"name\\\": \\\"punctuation.definition.string.end.mind\\\" }\\n          }\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"numbers\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"constant.numeric.mind\\\",\\n      \\\"match\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F]+|0[bB][01]+|0[oO][0-7]+|\\\\\\\\d+(?:\\\\\\\\.\\\\\\\\d+)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\\\\\d+)?)\\\\\\\\b\\\"\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"keywords\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"keyword.control.mind\\\",\\n      \\\"match\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\b(if|else|elif|while|for|switch|case|default|break|continue|return|def|class|struct|enum|union|typedef|import|from|as|pass|yield|lambda|with|try|except|finally|raise|assert|del|global|nonlocal|in|is|and|or|not|void|const|static|extern|register|volatile|inline|sizeof|typedef)\\\\\\\\b\\\",\\n      \\\"comment\\\": \\\"控制流关键字 + Python/C 关键字\\\"\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"types\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"storage.type.mind\\\",\\n      \\\"match\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\b(int|float|double|char|bool|_Bool|short|long|signed|unsigned|size_t|ssize_t|uint8_t|uint16_t|uint32_t|uint64_t|int8_t|int16_t|int32_t|int64_t|string|list|dict|tuple|set|True|False|None|nullptr|NULL|void|auto)\\\\\\\\b\\\",\\n      \\\"comment\\\": \\\"类型关键字\\\"\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"constants\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"constant.language.mind\\\",\\n      \\\"match\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\b(TRUE|FALSE|NULL|None|nullptr|true|false|null|nil|PI|E|INFINITY|NAN|EOF|MAX|MIN)\\\\\\\\b\\\"\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"function-calls\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"support.function.c.mind\\\",\\n      \\\"match\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\b([a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*)\\\\\\\\s*(?=\\\\\\\\()\\\",\\n      \\\"captures\\\": {\\n        \\\"1\\\": { \\\"name\\\": \\\"entity.name.function.mind\\\" }\\n      },\\n      \\\"comment\\\": \\\"C/Python 函数调用: func(...)\\\"\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"function-definitions\\\": {\\n      \\\"patterns\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"meta.function.python.mind\\\",\\n          \\\"match\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\b(def)\\\\\\\\s+([a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*)\\\",\\n          \\\"captures\\\": {\\n            \\\"1\\\": { \\\"name\\\": \\\"keyword.control.mind\\\" },\\n            \\\"2\\\": { \\\"name\\\": \\\"entity.name.function.mind\\\" }\\n          },\\n          \\\"comment\\\": \\\"Python 函数定义: def name\\\"\\n        },\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"meta.function.c.mind\\\",\\n          \\\"match\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\b((?:int|float|double|char|void|bool|long|short|unsigned|signed|size_t|struct\\\\\\\\s+[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*|const)\\\\\\\\s+[*\\\\\\\\s]*)([a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*)\\\\\\\\s*\\\\\\\\(\\\",\\n          \\\"captures\\\": {\\n            \\\"1\\\": { \\\"name\\\": \\\"storage.type.mind\\\" },\\n            \\\"2\\\": { \\\"name\\\": \\\"entity.name.function.mind\\\" }\\n          },\\n          \\\"comment\\\": \\\"C 函数定义: type name(...)\\\"\\n        }\\n      ]\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"pointers\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"keyword.operator.pointer.mind\\\",\\n      \\\"match\\\": \\\"(->|→|\\\\\\\\.\\\\\\\\*|::)\\\",\\n      \\\"comment\\\": \\\"指针/箭头/作用域运算符\\\"\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"operators\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"keyword.operator.mind\\\",\\n      \\\"match\\\": \\\"(?:[+\\\\\\\\-*/%&|^~!<>=]=?|<=>|&&|\\\\\\\\|\\\\\\\\||\\\\\\\\+\\\\\\\\+|--|->|→|≥|≤|≠|≡|∷)\\\",\\n      \\\"comment\\\": \\\"运算符 + 数学符号\\\"\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"punctuation\\\": {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"punctuation.mind\\\",\\n      \\\"match\\\": \\\"[(){}\\\\\\\\[\\\\\\\\],;:]\\\"\\n    },\\n\\n    \\\"natural-language\\\": {\\n      \\\"patterns\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"variable.other.noun.mind\\\",\\n          \\\"match\\\": \\\"\\\\\\\\b[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*\\\\\\\\b\\\",\\n          \\\"comment\\\": \\\"普通标识符作为名词/实体名（兜底规则，需在最后匹配）\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"comment\\\": \\\"自然语言和标识符。匹配未被前面规则捕获的词汇。\\\"\\n    }\\n  },\\n  \\\"comment\\\": \\\"Mind Language TextMate 语法。定义了 18 种语义分类的语法高亮规则，支持 C 风格、Python 风格和自然语言混合。\\\"\\n}\\n\", \"path\": \"/AI   文件夹/mind-extension/syntaxes/mind.tmLanguage.json\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"Now for the TextMate grammar. This is the syntax highlighting definition. I need to define 18 token types for the .mind language:\n\n1. keyword (control flow)\n2. c-call (C function calls) - pattern: word + ()\n3. py-def / c-def (function definitions)\n4. decl / ref (variable declarations/references) \n5. type / user-type\n6. nl-verb / nl-noun (natural language)\n7. operator / ptr-op\n8. number / const\n9. string / char\n10. comment\n11. punct\n\nTextMate grammars work with regex-based rules that match patterns in the text and assign them to scopes. The scopes are then mapped to colors by the VS Code theme.\n\nLet me create a comprehensive TextMate grammar for .mind.\n\nActually, I should design the grammar to use TextMate standard scopes so that existing themes can color it properly. But since we also have semantic tokens from the AI analysis, the TextMate grammar is a fallback for basic highlighting.\n\nLet me map the mind token types to TextMate scopes:\n\n| Mind Type | TextMate Scope |\n|-----------|---------------|\n| keyword | keyword.control.mind |\n| c-call | support.function.c.mind |\n| py-def | entity.name.function.mind |\n| c-def | entity.name.function.mind |\n| decl | variable.other.declaration.mind |\n| ref | variable.other.readwrite.mind |\n| type | storage.type.mind |\n| user-type | entity.name.type.mind |\n| nl-verb | keyword.operator.verbal.mind |\n| nl-noun | variable.other.noun.mind |\n| operator | keyword.operator.mind |\n| ptr-op | keyword.operator.pointer.mind |\n| number | constant.numeric.mind |\n| const | constant.language.mind |\n| string | string.quoted.mind |\n| char | string.quoted.single.mind |\n| comment | comment.line.mind |\n| punct | punctuation.mind |\n\nFor the grammar patterns, I need to define regex patterns:\n\n1. Comments: `# ...`, `// ...`, `/* ... */`\n2. Strings: `\"...\"`, `'...'`\n3. Numbers: integers and floats\n4. Keywords: if/else/while/for/switch/return/break/continue/def/struct\n5. Types: int/float/void/char/double/struct/union/enum/signed/unsigned/short/long\n6. Constants: TRUE/FALSE/NULL/None/nullptr\n7. Function calls: `word(`\n8. Function definitions: `def word` or `type word(`\n9. Pointers/arrows: `->`, `→`\n10. Operators: + - * / = ≥ ≤ > < != == >= <=\n11. Punctuation: ( ) { } [ ] , ; :\n\nFor natural language, it's harder to define regex patterns. We'll rely more on the AI analysis for those. But we can match general text as \"noun\" or \"verb\" based on position.\n\nLet me write the grammar."}
