{"role":"assistant","content":"## Step 8-11: 安装依赖 + 构建配置","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_2U7hIBEdsCrVZcxJrge95617","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"content\": \"{\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"mind-language\\\",\\n  \\\"version\\\": \\\"1.0.0\\\",\\n  \\\"description\\\": \\\"Mind 自然语言语义标注系统 — VS Code 插件\\\",\\n  \\\"private\\\": true,\\n  \\\"scripts\\\": {\\n    \\\"vscode:prepublish\\\": \\\"npm run build\\\",\\n    \\\"build\\\": \\\"esbuild src/extension.ts --bundle --outfile=dist/extension.js --external:vscode --format=cjs --platform=node --minify\\\",\\n    \\\"watch\\\": \\\"esbuild src/extension.ts --bundle --outfile=dist/extension.js --external:vscode --format=cjs --platform=node --watch\\\",\\n    \\\"lint\\\": \\\"tsc --noEmit\\\",\\n    \\\"package\\\": \\\"vsce package\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"devDependencies\\\": {\\n    \\\"@types/vscode\\\": \\\"^1.82.0\\\",\\n    \\\"esbuild\\\": \\\"^0.24.0\\\",\\n    \\\"typescript\\\": \\\"^5.5.0\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"engines\\\": {\\n    \\\"vscode\\\": \\\"^1.82.0\\\"\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"path\": \"/AI   文件夹/mind-extension/package.json\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"Now I need to:\n1. Install the extension dependencies (should be minimal - just @types/vscode and maybe esbuild for bundling)\n2. Create the build system (esbuild or just compile with tsc)\n3. Create the README for the extension\n4. Create the overall README\n\nLet me also create an icon (a simple SVG/PNG). Since I can't create real images, I'll use a simple SVG.\n\nLet me install the dependencies first, then set up the build system.\n\nActually, for VS Code extensions, I need `@types/vscode` for development. And for packaging, `vsce` needs the extension to be compiled. Let me set up the build with esbuild which is the recommended approach.\n\nLet me also think about what dependencies are needed:\n- `@types/vscode` - dev dependency\n- `esbuild` - for bundling (much faster than tsc alone)\n\nLet me proceed."}
