{"role":"assistant","content":"### 创建示例 .mind 文件","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_XrzNJxoaJI1N1m8Nx51k9329","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"content\": \"# ============================================================\\n# mind 语言示例文件 — 展示所有 18 种词汇类型\\n# ============================================================\\n# Mind 是一种纯描述性语言，混合自然语言、C 风格和 Python 风格语法。\\n# 本文件只做演示，不运行、不编译。\\n\\n# ---- 1. 基础操作 ----\\nCount node num\\nif num ≥ 30\\n  delete minimum num\\n  add node count to total\\nprint result\\n\\n# ---- 2. 控制流 + 函数 ----\\ndef process_data(nums)\\n  if len(nums) == 0\\n    print \\\"empty array\\\"\\n    return NULL\\n  sorted = sort(nums)\\n  return sorted\\n\\n# ---- 3. C 风格类型和指针 ----\\nstruct Node {\\n  int data\\n  Node* next\\n}\\n\\nint main(void) {\\n  Node* head → NULL\\n  int count = 0\\n  return 0\\n}\\n\\n# ---- 4. Python 风格 ----\\nclass Stack:\\n  def push(self, item):\\n    items → append(item)\\n  def pop(self):\\n    if len(items) > 0\\n      return items → remove_last()\\n    return None\\n\\n# ---- 5. 纯自然语言描述 ----\\n收集所有学生的成绩\\n如果平均分 ≥ 60\\n  输出\\\"及格\\\"\\n否则\\n  输出\\\"不及格\\\"\\n\\n# ---- 6. 混合风格 ----\\n# 描述一个排序算法\\ndef quick_sort(arr)\\n  # 基准条件\\n  if len(arr) ≤ 1\\n    return arr\\n  pivot = arr[0]\\n  left = []\\n  right = []\\n  for each x in arr[1:]\\n    if x < pivot\\n      left → append(x)\\n    else\\n      right → append(x)\\n  result = quick_sort(left) + [pivot] + quick_sort(right)\\n  return result\\n\", \"path\": \"/AI   文件夹/mind-extension/example.mind\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"Now let me also create an example .mind file to demonstrate the language, and then the overall project README."}
