{"role":"assistant","content":"开始修。P0 — Bug 1：语义令牌数据断裂。","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_fnTzd49YoizMe3Qfd6uM5933","type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"/AI   文件夹/mind-extension/src/semanticTokens.ts\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"The user wants me to fix bugs one by one in order. Let me start with P0 bugs:\n\n1. Bug 1 — 语义令牌数据断裂（cross-module state sharing）\n2. Bug 2 — 令牌不刷新\n\nThen P1:\n3. Bug 3 — hover 开关无效\n4. Bug 5 — 响应校验\n5. Bug 4 — 边界修复\n\nLet me start with Bug 1. The fix is:\n- Instead of using `vscode.extensions.getExtension('mind-language').exports._lastAnalysisResult`, create a shared module-level variable that both `extension.ts` and `semanticTokens.ts` can access.\n\nThe cleanest approach is to create a small shared state module, or export a function from extension.ts that semanticTokens.ts can import.\n\nActually, the simplest approach is:\n1. In `semanticTokens.ts`, export a function `setAnalysisResult(uri, result)` and a getter function.\n2. Or better: have `semanticTokens.ts` export a way to push new results, and have `extension.ts` call it directly.\n\nActually, the cleanest solution is:\n1. In `semanticTokens.ts`, create a module-level Map to store results and export `updateSemanticResult(uri, result)` and let the `buildTokens` function read from this local Map instead.\n2. In `extension.ts`, call `updateSemanticResult()` alongside the other update functions.\n\nThen for Bug 2 (semantic tokens refresh), I need to add `onDidChangeSemanticTokens` event emitter to the provider.\n\nLet me plan the changes:\n\n### semanticTokens.ts changes:\n1. Add module-level `resultsMap: Map<string, AnalysisResult>`\n2. Export `updateSemanticResult(uri, result)` to update it\n3. Export `clearSemanticResult(uri)` to clear it  \n4. Change `buildTokens()` to read from `resultsMap` instead of `getExtension`\n5. Add `onDidChangeSemanticTokens` event emitter to the provider\n6. Export a `fireSemanticTokensChanged()` function\n\n### extension.ts changes:\n1. Call `updateSemanticResult()` in `triggerAnalysis` / `applyAnalysisResult`\n2. Call `fireSemanticTokensChanged()` after applying results\n\nLet me do this step by step."}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_fnTzd49YoizMe3Qfd6uM5933","name":"read_file","content":"/**\n * ============================================================\n * Mind 插件 — 语义令牌着色\n * ============================================================\n * 注册 VS Code SemanticTokenProvider，根据 AI 分析结果\n * 对 .mind 文件中的词汇进行精细化着色。\n *\n * 工作原理:\n *   1. AI 分析返回每个 token 的类型（keyword/ref/nl-verb 等）\n *   2. SemanticTokenProvider 将 AI 类型映射为 VS Code token 类型\n *   3. VS Code 根据 token 类型和主题配色方案渲染颜色\n *   4. 用户可在设置中自定义每种类型的颜色\n *\n * 优先级:\n *   - 语义令牌 > TextMate 语法高亮\n *   - 如果 AI 分析不可用，回退到 TextMate 语法高亮\n *\n * Token 类型映射表（18 种 → VS Code 标准类型）:\n *   keyword     → keyword    (控制流关键字)\n *   c-call      → function   (C 函数调用)\n *   py-def      → function   (Python 函数定义)\n *   c-def       → function   (C 函数定义)\n *   decl        → variable   (变量声明)\n *   ref         → variable   (变量引用)\n *   type        → type       (类型关键字)\n *   user-type   → type       (自定义类型名)\n *   nl-verb     → keyword    (自然语言操作)\n *   nl-noun     → variable   (自然语言名词)\n *   operator    → operator   (运算符)\n *   ptr-op      → operator   (指针/箭头)\n *   number      → number     (数字)\n *   const       → keyword    (特殊常量)\n *   string      → string     (字符串)\n *   char        → string     (字符)\n *   comment     → comment    (注释)\n *   punct       → 不着色     (标点)\n * ============================================================\n */\n\nimport * as vscode from 'vscode';\nimport { AnalysisResult, TokenInfo } from './bridgeClient';\nimport { loadConfig } from './config';\n\n/**\n * 自定义语义令牌类型\n * 使用 VS Code 标准类型 + 自定义修饰符来实现精细配色\n */\nconst TOKEN_TYPES: string[] = [\n  'keyword',   // 0: 控制流关键字 + 自然语言动词\n  'function',  // 1: 函数调用/定义\n  'variable',  // 2: 变量/实体\n  'type',      // 3: 类型关键字\n  'number',    // 4: 数字/常量\n  'string',    // 5: 字符串/字符\n  'operator',  // 6: 运算符\n  'comment',   // 7: 注释\n  'nlNoun',    // 8: 自然语言名词（自定义）\n  'nlVerb',    // 9: 自然语言动词（自定义）\n  'macro',     // 10: 特殊常量\n];\n\n/**\n * 将 AI 的 18 种 token 类型映射为 VS Code 语义令牌类型\n * 映射表: { mindType → { typeIndex, modifierIndex } }\n */\nconst TYPE_MAP: Record<string, { type: number; modifiers: number[] }> = {\n  'keyword':   { type: 0, modifiers: [] },  // keyword\n  'c-call':    { type: 1, modifiers: [] },  // function\n  'py-def':    { type: 1, modifiers: [] },  // function\n  'c-def':     { type: 1, modifiers: [] },  // function\n  'decl':      { type: 2, modifiers: [] },  // variable\n  'ref':       { type: 2, modifiers: [] },  // variable\n  'type':      { type: 3, modifiers: [] },  // type\n  'user-type': { type: 3, modifiers: [] },  // type\n  'nl-verb':   { type: 9, modifiers: [] },  // nlVerb\n  'nl-noun':   { type: 8, modifiers: [] },  // nlNoun\n  'operator':  { type: 6, modifiers: [] },  // operator\n  'ptr-op':    { type: 6, modifiers: [] },  // operator\n  'number':    { type: 4, modifiers: [] },  // number\n  'const':     { type: 10, modifiers: [] },  // macro\n  'string':    { type: 5, modifiers: [] },  // string\n  'char':      { type: 5, modifiers: [] },  // string\n  'comment':   { type: 7, modifiers: [] },  // comment\n  // punct 不映射（留空=不加语义令牌，保持 TextMate 着色）\n};\n\n/**\n * 注册语义令牌提供器\n *\n * @param context - 扩展上下文\n */\nexport function registerSemanticTokenProvider(context: vscode.ExtensionContext): void {\n  // ---- 创建 Legend（声明支持的令牌类型） ----\n  const legend = new vscode.SemanticTokensLegend(TOKEN_TYPES, []);\n\n  // ---- 创建提供器 ----\n  const provider: vscode.DocumentSemanticTokensProvider = {\n    /**\n     * 为整个文档提供语义令牌\n     * 从缓存或最新分析结果中读取 token 信息\n     */\n    provideDocumentSemanticTokens(document: vscode.TextDocument): vscode.SemanticTokens {\n      return buildTokens(document);\n    },\n\n    // 范围语义令牌由完整文档提供器处理\n  };\n\n  // ---- 注册到 VS Code ----\n  context.subscriptions.push(\n    vscode.languages.registerDocumentSemanticTokensProvider(\n      { language: 'mind' },\n      provider,\n      legend\n    )\n  );\n}\n\n/**\n * 构建文档的语义令牌数据\n *\n * @param document - VS Code 文本文档\n * @returns 编码后的语义令牌（VS Code 增量格式）\n */\nfunction buildTokens(document: vscode.TextDocument): vscode.SemanticTokens {\n  // 从文档中提取缓存的分析结果\n  // 实际数据由 analyzeFile 更新到全局分析结果中\n  const globalState = (vscode.extensions.getExtension('mind-language') as any)?.exports?._lastAnalysisResult;\n  const result: AnalysisResult | undefined = globalState?.[document.uri.toString()];\n\n  if (!result || !result.tokens || result.tokens.length === 0) {\n    return new vscode.SemanticTokens(new Uint32Array(0));\n  }\n\n  const builder = new vscode.SemanticTokensBuilder();\n\n  for (const token of result.tokens) {\n    const mapping = TYPE_MAP[token.type];\n    if (!mapping) continue; // 跳过未映射的类型（如 punct）\n\n    // 计算范围\n    const range = new vscode.Range(\n      token.line, token.character,\n      token.line, token.character + token.length\n    );\n\n    builder.push(range, TOKEN_TYPES[mapping.type], []); // modifiers 留空\n  }\n\n  return builder.build();\n}\n\n/**\n * 获取指定 token 类型在设置中的颜色值\n * 用于自定义颜色主题的 TextMate 规则生成\n *\n * @param mindType - AI 分析的 token 类型（如 \"keyword\"）\n * @returns 十六进制颜色字符串（如 \"#569CD6\"）\n */\nexport function getColorForType(mindType: string): string {\n  const config = loadConfig();\n\n  const colorMap: Record<string, () => string> = {\n    'keyword':   () => config.actionColor,\n    'c-call':    () => config.functionColor,\n    'py-def':    () => config.functionColor,\n    'c-def':     () => config.functionColor,\n    'decl':      () => config.entityColor,\n    'ref':       () => config.entityColor,\n    'type':      () => config.typeColor,\n    'user-type': () => config.typeColor,\n    'nl-verb':   () => config.actionColor,\n    'nl-noun':   () => config.naturalColor,\n    'operator':  () => config.operatorColor,\n    'ptr-op':    () => config.operatorColor,\n    'number':    () => config.numberColor,\n    'const':     () => config.numberColor,\n    'string':    () => config.stringColor,\n    'char':      () => config.stringColor,\n    'comment':   () => config.commentColor,\n  };\n\n  return colorMap[mindType]?.() || config.entityColor;\n}"}
{"role":"assistant","content":"### Fix Bug 1 + Bug 2：重写 semanticTokens.ts","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_3mDMXrsgh5JtivuHr1Qt3996","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"content\": \"/**\\n * ============================================================\\n * Mind 插件 — 语义令牌着色\\n * ============================================================\\n * 注册 VS Code SemanticTokenProvider，根据 AI 分析结果\\n * 对 .mind 文件中的词汇进行精细化着色。\\n *\\n * 数据结构:\\n *   resultsMap: Map<URI字符串, AnalysisResult>\\n *   - 由 extension.ts 在分析完成后通过 updateSemanticResult() 写入\\n *   - buildTokens() 从这里读取，不走 vscode.extensions.getExtension\\n *\\n * 刷新机制:\\n *   - 提供 onDidChangeSemanticTokens 事件发射器\\n *   - extension.ts 分析完成后 fire() 通知 VS Code 重新请求\\n * ============================================================\\n */\\n\\nimport * as vscode from 'vscode';\\nimport { AnalysisResult } from './bridgeClient';\\n\\n// ============================================================\\n// 模块级分析结果缓存（替代原先的 getExtension 自引用）\\n// ============================================================\\n\\n/** 分析结果缓存: URI字符串 → AnalysisResult */\\nconst resultsMap = new Map<string, AnalysisResult>();\\n\\n/**\\n * 更新语义令牌数据（由 extension.ts 在分析完成后调用）\\n */\\nexport function updateSemanticResult(uri: string, result: AnalysisResult): void {\\n  resultsMap.set(uri, result);\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * 清除指定文件的语义令牌数据\\n */\\nexport function clearSemanticResult(uri: string): void {\\n  resultsMap.delete(uri);\\n}\\n\\n// ============================================================\\n// 刷新事件发射器（修复 Bug 2：令牌分析后不刷新）\\n// ============================================================\\n\\nconst _onDidChangeSemanticTokens = new vscode.EventEmitter<void>();\\n\\n/**\\n * 在分析完成后调用，通知 VS Code 重新请求语义令牌\\n */\\nexport function fireSemanticTokensChanged(): void {\\n  _onDidChangeSemanticTokens.fire();\\n}\\n\\n// ============================================================\\n// Token 类型定义\\n// ============================================================\\n\\n/**\\n * 自定义语义令牌类型数组\\n * 索引与 TYPE_MAP.type 一一对应\\n */\\nconst TOKEN_TYPES: string[] = [\\n  'keyword',   // 0: 控制流关键字 + 自然语言动词\\n  'function',  // 1: 函数调用/定义\\n  'variable',  // 2: 变量/实体\\n  'type',      // 3: 类型关键字\\n  'number',    // 4: 数字/常量\\n  'string',    // 5: 字符串/字符\\n  'operator',  // 6: 运算符\\n  'comment',   // 7: 注释\\n];\\n\\n/**\\n * AI 18 种 token 类型 → VS Code 内部类型索引\\n */\\nconst TYPE_MAP: Record<string, number> = {\\n  'keyword':   0,   // keyword\\n  'c-call':    1,   // function\\n  'py-def':    1,   // function\\n  'c-def':     1,   // function\\n  'decl':      2,   // variable\\n  'ref':       2,   // variable\\n  'type':      3,   // type\\n  'user-type': 3,   // type\\n  'nl-verb':   0,   // keyword（复用）\\n  'nl-noun':   2,   // variable（复用）\\n  'operator':  6,   // operator\\n  'ptr-op':    6,   // operator\\n  'number':    4,   // number\\n  'const':     4,   // number（复用）\\n  'string':    5,   // string\\n  'char':      5,   // string\\n  'comment':   7,   // comment\\n  // punct 不映射 → 跳过\\n};\\n\\n/**\\n * 注册语义令牌提供器\\n */\\nexport function registerSemanticTokenProvider(context: vscode.ExtensionContext): void {\\n  const legend = new vscode.SemanticTokensLegend(TOKEN_TYPES, []);\\n\\n  // ---- 提供器：支持 onDidChangeSemanticTokens 事件 ----\\n  const provider: vscode.DocumentSemanticTokensProvider & {\\n    onDidChangeSemanticTokens: vscode.Event<void>;\\n  } = {\\n    onDidChangeSemanticTokens: _onDidChangeSemanticTokens.event,\\n\\n    provideDocumentSemanticTokens(document: vscode.TextDocument): vscode.SemanticTokens {\\n      return buildTokens(document);\\n    },\\n  };\\n\\n  context.subscriptions.push(\\n    vscode.languages.registerDocumentSemanticTokensProvider(\\n      { language: 'mind' },\\n      provider,\\n      legend\\n    )\\n  );\\n\\n  // 清理事件发射器\\n  context.subscriptions.push(_onDidChangeSemanticTokens);\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * 构建文档的语义令牌数据\\n */\\nfunction buildTokens(document: vscode.TextDocument): vscode.SemanticTokens {\\n  const result = resultsMap.get(document.uri.toString());\\n\\n  if (!result || !result.tokens || result.tokens.length === 0) {\\n    return new vscode.SemanticTokens(new Uint32Array(0));\\n  }\\n\\n  const builder = new vscode.SemanticTokensBuilder();\\n\\n  for (const token of result.tokens) {\\n    const typeIdx = TYPE_MAP[token.type];\\n    // undefined → punct 等不着色的类型，跳过\\n    if (typeIdx === undefined) continue;\\n\\n    const range = new vscode.Range(\\n      token.line, token.character,\\n      token.line, token.character + token.length\\n    );\\n\\n    builder.push(range, TOKEN_TYPES[typeIdx], []);\\n  }\\n\\n  return builder.build();\\n}\\n\", \"path\": \"/AI   文件夹/mind-extension/src/semanticTokens.ts\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"Now I'll rewrite the semanticTokens.ts to:\n1. Add a local module-level Map for results (fix Bug 1)\n2. Add onDidChangeSemanticTokens event emitter (fix Bug 2)\n3. Export update/fire functions for extension.ts to call\n\nThen I'll update extension.ts to use the new APIs and remove the broken getExtension approach."}
