{"role":"assistant","content":"现在实现 Bug 11 — 分支符号（`├─` `└─`）：","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_G7Lho3zDhSv8KS3czkEG5181","type":"function","function":{"name":"read_file","arguments":"{\"path\": \"/AI   文件夹/mind-extension/src/indentDecoration.ts\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"Now fix Bug 11 — add branch detection symbols (├─ └─) to indent lines. This requires enhancing `indentDecoration.ts` to:\n\n1. After calculating levels per line, determine which lines are \"branch points\" (have children at a deeper level)\n2. For the last child at each level, use `└─ ` instead of `├─ `\n3. Use `│ ` for continuation lines (not branching)\n\nThis is more complex. Let me update the indent decoration logic.\n\nActually, looking at the original design more carefully:\n\n```\n│Count node num\n│if num ≥ 30\n│  ├─ delete minimum num\n│  └─ add node count to total\n│print result\n```\n\nThe pattern is:\n- `│ ` at the beginning of every non-blank line at level 0\n- At level 1+, `├─ ` before items that have siblings after them, `└─ ` before the last item\n\nTo implement this, I need to:\n1. Build a tree structure from the nesting data\n2. For each line, determine if it's the last child of its parent\n3. Render `├─ ` or `└─ ` accordingly\n\nBut this is getting complex for what's fundamentally a visual decoration. Let me implement a simpler version: use `├─ ` for all items at level > 0, and `│ ` for level 0. The `└─ ` distinction requires sibling analysis which adds complexity.\n\nActually, let me implement it properly. It's not that hard.\n\nFor each line at level N:\n- Look ahead to find the next line at level ≤ N\n- If there is no next line at level N, this is the last child → `└─ `\n- Otherwise → `├─ `\n\nLet me rewrite the indentDecoration.ts."}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_G7Lho3zDhSv8KS3czkEG5181","name":"read_file","content":"/**\n * ============================================================\n * Mind 插件 — 缩进关系线装饰\n * ============================================================\n * 在文本左侧绘制彩色垂直缩进线，表示逻辑从属关系。\n *\n * 效果:\n *   │ Count node num\n *   │ if num ≥ 30\n *   │   ├─ delete minimum num\n *   │   └─ add node count to total\n *   │ print result\n *\n * 设计:\n *   - 每层缩进对应一根垂直线\n *   - 每层线的颜色不同（从 indentColors 数组中按索引取色）\n *   - 用户可在设置中开关和自定义颜色\n *   - 每当编辑器内容变化或分析结果更新时重新渲染\n * ============================================================\n */\n\nimport * as vscode from 'vscode';\nimport { AnalysisResult, NestingInfo } from './bridgeClient';\nimport { loadConfig, MindConfig } from './config';\n\n/** 装饰类型集合（每种层级一个） */\nlet indentDecorations: vscode.TextEditorDecorationType[] = [];\n\n/**\n * 注册缩进关系线\n * 监听编辑器事件，在有 .mind 文件打开时渲染缩进线\n *\n * @param context - 扩展上下文\n */\nexport function registerIndentDecorations(context: vscode.ExtensionContext): void {\n  const config = loadConfig();\n\n  // ---- 初始化装饰类型 ----\n  rebuildDecorationTypes(config);\n\n  // ---- 监听活跃编辑器变化 ----\n  context.subscriptions.push(\n    vscode.window.onDidChangeActiveTextEditor((editor) => {\n      if (editor && editor.document.languageId === 'mind') {\n        updateDecorations(editor);\n      }\n    })\n  );\n\n  // ---- 监听文本内容变化 ----\n  context.subscriptions.push(\n    vscode.workspace.onDidChangeTextDocument((event) => {\n      const editor = vscode.window.activeTextEditor;\n      if (editor && editor.document === event.document && editor.document.languageId === 'mind') {\n        // 缩进线由文本缩进直接决定，不依赖 AI 分析\n        renderIndentLines(editor);\n      }\n    })\n  );\n\n  // ---- 监听配置变化（实时更新颜色） ----\n  context.subscriptions.push(\n    vscode.workspace.onDidChangeConfiguration((event) => {\n      if (event.affectsConfiguration('mind.indentColors') || event.affectsConfiguration('mind.enableIndentLines')) {\n        const newConfig = loadConfig();\n        rebuildDecorationTypes(newConfig);\n\n        const editor = vscode.window.activeTextEditor;\n        if (editor && editor.document.languageId === 'mind') {\n          renderIndentLines(editor);\n        }\n      }\n    })\n  );\n\n  // ---- 初始渲染 ----\n  if (vscode.window.activeTextEditor?.document.languageId === 'mind') {\n    renderIndentLines(vscode.window.activeTextEditor);\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * 重建所有层级的装饰类型\n * 在颜色配置变化时调用\n */\nfunction rebuildDecorationTypes(config: MindConfig): void {\n  // 清除旧装饰\n  for (const dec of indentDecorations) {\n    dec.dispose();\n  }\n  indentDecorations = [];\n\n  // 如果缩进线被禁用，不创建装饰\n  if (!config.enableIndentLines) return;\n\n  // 为每个层级创建装饰类型\n  // 最多支持 8 层缩进\n  const maxLevels = Math.min(config.indentColors.length, 8);\n  for (let level = 0; level < maxLevels; level++) {\n    const color = config.indentColors[level] || config.indentColors[config.indentColors.length - 1];\n\n    indentDecorations.push(\n      vscode.window.createTextEditorDecorationType({\n        before: {\n          contentText: '│ ',\n          color: color,\n          fontWeight: 'normal',\n          margin: '0 0 0 0',\n        },\n        opacity: '0.6',\n        rangeBehavior: vscode.DecorationRangeBehavior.OpenOpen,\n      })\n    );\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * 渲染缩进关系线\n * 基于每行开头的缩进空格数绘制层级竖线\n *\n * @param editor - 当前编辑器\n */\nexport function renderIndentLines(editor: vscode.TextEditor): void {\n  const config = loadConfig();\n  if (!config.enableIndentLines) {\n    // 清除所有缩进线\n    for (const dec of indentDecorations) {\n      editor.setDecorations(dec, []);\n    }\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const document = editor.document;\n  const lineCount = document.lineCount;\n\n  // 为每层收集需要添加装饰的行\n  const linesPerLevel: Map<number, vscode.Range[]> = new Map();\n  for (let level = 0; level < indentDecorations.length; level++) {\n    linesPerLevel.set(level, []);\n  }\n\n  for (let lineIdx = 0; lineIdx < lineCount; lineIdx++) {\n    const line = document.lineAt(lineIdx);\n\n    // 跳过空行\n    if (line.isEmptyOrWhitespace) continue;\n\n    // 计算缩进层级（每 2 个空格 = 1 级）\n    const indentText = line.text.match(/^(\\s*)/)?.[1] || '';\n    const level = Math.floor(indentText.length / 2);\n\n    // 为当前层级及以上的所有层级添加竖线\n    // 即：如果 level=2，画 3 根线（level 0, 1, 2）\n    for (let l = 0; l <= level && l < indentDecorations.length; l++) {\n      const ranges = linesPerLevel.get(l);\n      if (ranges) {\n        ranges.push(new vscode.Range(lineIdx, 0, lineIdx, 0));\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  // 应用装饰\n  for (let level = 0; level < indentDecorations.length; level++) {\n    const ranges = linesPerLevel.get(level) || [];\n    const decoration = indentDecorations[level];\n    if (decoration) {\n      editor.setDecorations(decoration, ranges);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * 根据 AI 分析的 nesting 数据更新缩进线\n * 当 AI 分析结果返回时调用，使用 AI 的层级判断（更准确）\n *\n * @param editor - 当前编辑器\n * @param nesting - AI 分析的缩进层级数据\n */\nexport function updateDecorationsFromAnalysis(\n  editor: vscode.TextEditor,\n  nesting: NestingInfo[]\n): void {\n  const config = loadConfig();\n  if (!config.enableIndentLines) return;\n\n  // 如果 AI 提供了 nesting 数据，使用它；否则回退到本地缩进计算\n  if (nesting && nesting.length > 0) {\n    const linesPerLevel: Map<number, vscode.Range[]> = new Map();\n    for (let level = 0; level < indentDecorations.length; level++) {\n      linesPerLevel.set(level, []);\n    }\n\n    for (const n of nesting) {\n      const level = n.level;\n      for (let l = 0; l <= level && l < indentDecorations.length; l++) {\n        const ranges = linesPerLevel.get(l);\n        if (ranges) {\n          ranges.push(new vscode.Range(n.line, 0, n.line, 0));\n        }\n      }\n    }\n\n    for (let level = 0; level < indentDecorations.length; level++) {\n      const ranges = linesPerLevel.get(level) || [];\n      const decoration = indentDecorations[level];\n      if (decoration) {\n        editor.setDecorations(decoration, ranges);\n      }\n    }\n  } else {\n    renderIndentLines(editor);\n  }\n}\n\n/**\n * 更新装饰（从分析结果或本地计算）\n */\nfunction updateDecorations(editor: vscode.TextEditor): void {\n  renderIndentLines(editor);\n}"}
{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_jcfMHp0aJBDRVGB6ehTc7612","type":"function","function":{"name":"write_file","arguments":"{\"content\": \"/**\\n * ============================================================\\n * Mind 插件 — 缩进关系线装饰\\n * ============================================================\\n * 在文本左侧绘制彩色垂直缩进线，表示逻辑从属关系。\\n *\\n * 效果:\\n *   │ Count node num\\n *   │ if num ≥ 30\\n *   │   ├─ delete minimum num\\n *   │   └─ add node count to total\\n *   │ print result\\n *\\n * 实现:\\n *   - 顶层级 (level 0): 使用 │  前缀\\n *   - 子层级 (level > 0): 根据是否有后续兄弟节点决定 ├─ 或 └─\\n *   - 每层颜色不同，可配置\\n *   - 同时渲染连续竖线（延续线），显示从属结构\\n * ============================================================\\n */\\n\\nimport * as vscode from 'vscode';\\nimport { NestingInfo } from './bridgeClient';\\nimport { loadConfig, MindConfig } from './config';\\n\\n/**\\n * 每个层级需要两种装饰类型:\\n *   branchDecos[l]     — 有后续兄弟 → \\\"├─ \\\"\\n *   lastChildDecos[l]  — 最后一个子节点 → \\\"└─ \\\"\\n *   contDecos[l]       — 延续竖线（该层级之后还有行）→ \\\"│ \\\"\\n */\\nlet branchDecos: vscode.TextEditorDecorationType[] = [];\\nlet lastChildDecos: vscode.TextEditorDecorationType[] = [];\\nlet contDecos: vscode.TextEditorDecorationType[] = [];\\n\\n/**\\n * 注册缩进关系线\\n */\\nexport function registerIndentDecorations(context: vscode.ExtensionContext): void {\\n  rebuildDecorationTypes(loadConfig());\\n\\n  // ---- 活跃编辑器切换 ----\\n  context.subscriptions.push(\\n    vscode.window.onDidChangeActiveTextEditor((editor) => {\\n      if (editor?.document.languageId === 'mind') {\\n        renderIndentLines(editor);\\n      }\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  // ---- 文本内容变化 ----\\n  context.subscriptions.push(\\n    vscode.workspace.onDidChangeTextDocument((event) => {\\n      const editor = vscode.window.activeTextEditor;\\n      if (editor && editor.document === event.document && editor.document.languageId === 'mind') {\\n        renderIndentLines(editor);\\n      }\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  // ---- 配置变化 ----\\n  context.subscriptions.push(\\n    vscode.workspace.onDidChangeConfiguration((event) => {\\n      if (event.affectsConfiguration('mind.indentColors') || event.affectsConfiguration('mind.enableIndentLines')) {\\n        rebuildDecorationTypes(loadConfig());\\n        const editor = vscode.window.activeTextEditor;\\n        if (editor?.document.languageId === 'mind') renderIndentLines(editor);\\n      }\\n    })\\n  );\\n\\n  // ---- 初始渲染 ----\\n  if (vscode.window.activeTextEditor?.document.languageId === 'mind') {\\n    renderIndentLines(vscode.window.activeTextEditor);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * 重建所有装饰类型\\n */\\nfunction rebuildDecorationTypes(config: MindConfig): void {\\n  // 清理旧装饰\\n  for (const arr of [branchDecos, lastChildDecos, contDecos]) {\\n    for (const d of arr) d.dispose();\\n  }\\n  branchDecos = [];\\n  lastChildDecos = [];\\n  contDecos = [];\\n\\n  if (!config.enableIndentLines) return;\\n\\n  const maxLevels = Math.min(config.indentColors.length, 8);\\n  for (let l = 0; l < maxLevels; l++) {\\n    const color = config.indentColors[l] || config.indentColors[config.indentColors.length - 1];\\n\\n    // ├─ 分支（有后续兄弟）\\n    branchDecos.push(\\n      vscode.window.createTextEditorDecorationType({\\n        before: { contentText: '├─ ', color, fontWeight: 'normal', margin: '0 0 0 0' },\\n        opacity: '0.5',\\n        rangeBehavior: vscode.DecorationRangeBehavior.OpenOpen,\\n      })\\n    );\\n\\n    // └─ 结尾（最后一个子节点）\\n    lastChildDecos.push(\\n      vscode.window.createTextEditorDecorationType({\\n        before: { contentText: '└─ ', color, fontWeight: 'normal', margin: '0 0 0 0' },\\n        opacity: '0.5',\\n        rangeBehavior: vscode.DecorationRangeBehavior.OpenOpen,\\n      })\\n    );\\n\\n    // │ 延续竖线（该层级之后还有内容）\\n    contDecos.push(\\n      vscode.window.createTextEditorDecorationType({\\n        before: { contentText: '│ ', color, fontWeight: 'normal', margin: '0 0 0 0' },\\n        opacity: '0.4',\\n        rangeBehavior: vscode.DecorationRangeBehavior.OpenOpen,\\n      })\\n    );\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * 解析文档中的缩进信息\\n * 返回按行索引排列的 { level, text, isEmpty }\\n */\\nfunction parseIndents(document: vscode.TextDocument): Array<{ level: number; text: string; isEmpty: boolean }> {\\n  const result: Array<{ level: number; text: string; isEmpty: boolean }> = [];\\n  for (let i = 0; i < document.lineCount; i++) {\\n    const text = document.lineAt(i).text;\\n    if (text.trim() === '') {\\n      result.push({ level: -1, text: '', isEmpty: true });\\n    } else {\\n      const indentMatch = text.match(/^(\\\\s*)/);\\n      const indentLen = indentMatch ? indentMatch[1].length : 0;\\n      result.push({ level: Math.floor(indentLen / 2), text, isEmpty: false });\\n    }\\n  }\\n  return result;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * 渲染缩进关系线\\n * 基于缩进层级计算分支逻辑\\n */\\nexport function renderIndentLines(editor: vscode.TextEditor): void {\\n  const config = loadConfig();\\n  if (!config.enableIndentLines || indentDecorationsEmpty()) {\\n    clearAllDecorations(editor);\\n    return;\\n  }\\n\\n  const lines = parseIndents(editor.document);\\n  const n = lines.length;\\n\\n  // 清除所有旧装饰\\n  clearAllDecorations(editor);\\n\\n  // 每层级的三种装饰分别收集 ranges\\n  const branchRanges: vscode.Range[][] = branchDecos.map(() => []);\\n  const lastRanges: vscode.Range[][] = lastChildDecos.map(() => []);\\n  const contRanges: vscode.Range[][] = contDecos.map(() => []);\\n\\n  const maxLevel = branchDecos.length;\\n\\n  // ---- 第一遍：计算\\\"该层级之后是否还有内容\\\"（延续竖线） ----\\n  // hasDeeper[maxLevel][lineIdx] = 该层级在 lineIdx 之后还有非空行\\n  const hasDeeper: boolean[][] = Array.from({ length: maxLevel }, () => new Array(n).fill(false));\\n\\n  for (let lvl = 0; lvl < maxLevel; lvl++) {\\n    let found = false;\\n    for (let i = n - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\\n      if (lines[i].isEmpty) {\\n        hasDeeper[lvl][i] = found;\\n      } else {\\n        // 当前行是否达到了 lvl？\\n        hasDeeper[lvl][i] = found || lines[i].level >= lvl;\\n        if (lines[i].level >= lvl) found = true;\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  // ---- 第二遍：分配装饰 ----\\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\\n    if (lines[i].isEmpty) continue;\\n    const lvl = lines[i].level;\\n    if (lvl < 0 || lvl >= maxLevel) continue;\\n\\n    // 判断当前行是否是其父级下的最后一个子节点\\n    const isLast = isLastChild(lines, i);\\n\\n    // 当前的线\\n    const range = new vscode.Range(i, 0, i, 0);\\n\\n    if (lvl === 0) {\\n      contRanges[0].push(range);\\n    } else if (isLast) {\\n      lastRanges[lvl].push(range);\\n    } else {\\n      branchRanges[lvl].push(range);\\n    }\\n\\n    // 为上层绘制延续竖线\\n    for (let upper = 0; upper < lvl; upper++) {\\n      if (hasDeeper[upper][i]) {\\n        contRanges[upper].push(range);\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  // ---- 应用装饰 ----\\n  for (let lvl = 0; lvl < maxLevel; lvl++) {\\n    if (branchRanges[lvl].length > 0) editor.setDecorations(branchDecos[lvl], branchRanges[lvl]);\\n    if (lastRanges[lvl].length > 0) editor.setDecorations(lastChildDecos[lvl], lastRanges[lvl]);\\n    if (contRanges[lvl].length > 0) editor.setDecorations(contDecos[lvl], contRanges[lvl]);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * 判断 lines[i] 是否为其父级下的最后一个子节点\\n */\\nfunction isLastChild(lines: Array<{ level: number; isEmpty: boolean }>, i: number): boolean {\\n  const lvl = lines[i].level;\\n  if (lvl <= 0) return true;\\n\\n  // 向后找下一个非空行\\n  for (let j = i + 1; j < lines.length; j++) {\\n    if (lines[j].isEmpty) continue;\\n    const nextLvl = lines[j].level;\\n    if (nextLvl <= lvl) {\\n      // 找到了同层或上层节点 → 当前节点不是最后一个\\n      return false;\\n    }\\n  }\\n  // 没找到同层或上层节点 → 当前节点是最后一个\\n  return true;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * 根据 AI 分析的 nesting 数据更新缩进线\\n */\\nexport function updateDecorationsFromAnalysis(\\n  editor: vscode.TextEditor,\\n  nesting: NestingInfo[]\\n): void {\\n  // 用本地方法重新计算（nesting 数据可能不全）\\n  renderIndentLines(editor);\\n}\\n\\nfunction clearAllDecorations(editor: vscode.TextEditor): void {\\n  for (const arr of [branchDecos, lastChildDecos, contDecos]) {\\n    for (const d of arr) editor.setDecorations(d, []);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\nfunction indentDecorationsEmpty(): boolean {\\n  return branchDecos.length === 0 && lastChildDecos.length === 0 && contDecos.length === 0;\\n}\\n\", \"path\": \"/AI   文件夹/mind-extension/src/indentDecoration.ts\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"To properly implement branch symbols (├─ └─), I need a different approach. Instead of using `before.contentText` with a static string, I need:\n\n1. Each line at level > 0 gets `├─ ` if it's NOT the last child at its level\n2. Each line at level > 0 gets `└─ ` if it IS the last child at its level\n3. Level 0 lines just get `│ `\n\nTo determine \"is this the last child?\", I need to look at the next non-empty line at the same level or higher. If the next line at this level or above has a smaller level (parent), then this is the last child.\n\nWait, actually: a line is the \"last child\" if the next line at level ≤ current level is at a LOWER level (meaning the parent's next sibling). Or if there is no next line at all.\n\nLet me think about this with an example:\n```\nline 0: level 0  → │\nline 1: level 1  → ├─\nline 2: level 2  → ├─\nline 3: level 1  → └─ (no more level 1 after this)\n```\n\nFor line 1 (level 1): next line at level ≤ 1 is line 3 (level 1). Since level(3) == level(1), there's another sibling → `├─ `\n\nFor line 3 (level 1): no next line at level ≤ 1 → `└─ `\n\nFor line 2 (level 2): next line at level ≤ 2 is line 3 (level 1). Since level(3) < level(2), this is the last child at level 2 → `└─ `\n\nActually wait, line 2 is the only child at level 2 under line 1. So yes, `└─ ` is correct.\n\nLet me implement this:\n\nFor each line with level L:\n- Look at next lines (index+1 onwards, skipping empties)\n- Find the first line with level ≤ L\n- If found AND its level is < L, then current line is the last child at level L → `└─ `\n- If found AND its level is == L, there's another sibling → `├─ `\n- If not found (end of file), this is the last child → `└─ `\n\nFor the implementation, I can't use `before.contentText` with different text per line using the same decoration type. I need to use multiple decoration types or a per-line approach.\n\nActually, I CAN use `before.contentText` per decoration type, but I need separate decoration types for `├─ ` and `└─ ` at each level. This means 2 * levels decoration types instead of just levels.\n\nOr better, I can use a single decoration type per \"pattern\" and apply it to a range of lines.\n\nActually, the simplest approach is: create TWO decoration types per level - one for \"branch\" (├─) and one for \"last child\" (└─). Then assign lines to the appropriate decoration.\n\nBut this gets complex. Let me use a simpler approach: create a single decoration type that uses a more flexible system. Actually, looking at VS Code's decoration API, I can use textDecoration with borders instead of before.contentText for the continuous vertical line part, and use before.contentText only for the branch points.\n\nLet me simplify: use a hybrid approach:\n1. `│ ` for level 0 lines (same as before)\n2. `├─ ` for level > 0 lines that have children or siblings after them\n3. `└─ ` for the last child at each level\n\nI need 2 decoration types per level, so max 8*2 = 16 decorations. That's manageable.\n\nLet me rewrite the file."}
