ooking at the previous successful test (Count node num example), it worked fine and returned 1261 characters of JSON. So the API works for our use case, just the last test had a transient issue.\n\nLet me fix the deepseekClient.js to handle empty content more gracefully - if `content` is empty but `reasoning_content` exists, try using that instead. Or better, if content is empty, throw a more descriptive error."}
