{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_YZKutYoDOhyPQas1Xx2w2833","name":"read_file","content":"[range 38-55 of 87 lines]\n    const response = await deepseek.chat.completions.create({\n      model: DEFAULT_MODEL,\n      messages: [\n        { role: 'system', content: systemPrompt },\n        { role: 'user', content: userContent }\n      ],\n      temperature: 0.1,           // 低温 → 输出更稳定、可预测\n      max_tokens: 4096,           // 足够返回分析结果\n      stream: false                // 非流式，直接获取完整 JSON\n    });\n\n    // 提取 AI 回复内容\n    const result = response.choices?.[0]?.message?.content;\n    if (!result) {\n      throw new Error('AI 返回了空响应');\n    }\n\n    return result;"}
{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_cf1NFJlEyW1NMKzswfEo2691","type":"function","function":{"name":"edit_file","arguments":"{\"search\": \"    // 提取 AI 回复内容\\n    const result = response.choices?.[0]?.message?.content;\\n    if (!result) {\\n      throw new Error('AI 返回了空响应');\\n    }\\n\\n    return result;\", \"path\": \"/AI   文件夹/mind-bridge/src/deepseekClient.js\", \"replace\": \"    // 提取 AI 回复内容\\n    const message = response.choices?.[0]?.message;\\n    const result = message?.content;\\n\\n    if (!result) {\\n      // 对于推理模型，content 可能为空但 reasoning_content 有值\\n      // 这说明模型把 token 预算全花在推理上了，没有输出\\n      const hasReasoning = !!(message as any)?.reasoning_content;\\n      const finishReason = response.choices?.[0]?.finish_reason;\\n      const detail = hasReasoning\\n        ? `模型推理消耗了所有 token 预算（finish_reason: ${finishReason}）`\\n        : `API 返回了空内容（finish_reason: ${finishReason}）`;\\n      throw new Error(`AI 返回了空响应: ${detail}`);\\n    }\\n\\n    return result;\"}"}}],"reasoning_content":"I see - when the `content` field is empty but the message has `reasoning_content`, we throw a generic error. Let me improve this to handle the reasoning_content case and provide a better error message.\n\nFor reasoning models like deepseek-v4-flash, the response could have:\n1. `content` → the actual response text\n2. `reasoning_content` → the model's reasoning/thinking (used internally)\n\nIf `content` is empty but `reasoning_content` has content, it means the reasoning model used all its tokens on reasoning and didn't produce an output. This is a token budget issue.\n\nLet me improve the error handling to be more specific."}
