{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_QBnGKig8Spw43bUUOzkh7941","type":"function","function":{"name":"submit_plan","arguments":"{\"summary\": \"三文件体系：.mind ↔ .py ↔ .c 自动生成 + 超链接导航\", \"plan\": \"# 三文件体系实施计划\\n\\n## 新增文件\\n\\n### 桥接端 (mind-bridge)\\n\\n| 文件 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `src/codeGenerator.js` | 代码生成引擎。系统提示词 → 解析 `# @d` 注释 → 调用 DeepSeek → 返回 Python + C 代码 + 位置映射 |\\n\\n### 插件端 (mind-extension/src)\\n\\n| 文件 | 说明 |\\n|------|------|\\n| `fileTriplet.ts` | 三文件关系管理。发现 .mind → 检查同目录 .py/.c → 不存在则创建空文件 → 维护映射表 |\\n| `docLinks.ts` | DocumentLinkProvider。`.mind` 中的 `# @d` → 可点击跳转到 .py/.c 对应函数；.py/.c 中的函数签名 → 可点击跳回 .mind 注释 |\\n\\n## 修改文件\\n\\n| 文件 | 改动 |\\n|------|------|\\n| **bridge/src/index.js** | 新增 `POST /generate` 端点 |\\n| **bridge/src/deepseekClient.js** | 无改动（复用现有调用） |\\n| **plugin/src/bridgeClient.ts** | 新增 `generateCode()` 函数 + `GenerationResult` 接口 |\\n| **plugin/src/extension.ts** | 分析完成后检测 `# @d` 注释 → 触发生成 → 写文件 → 注册链接 |\\n\\n## 数据流\\n\\n```\\n用户写完 # @d 实现XX → Enter触发\\n  → 防抖200ms → triggerAnalysis（现有）\\n  → 插件检测 results 中是否有 # @d 注释\\n  → POST /generate { content }\\n  → Bridge: 提取所有 # @d 行 → 调用DeepSeek生成双语言实现\\n  → 返回 { py: {code, links}, c: {code, links} }\\n  → 插件: 写入 project.py / project.c（增量更新）\\n  → 插件: 注册 DocumentLinkProvider 显示超链接\\n```\\n\\n## 三文件结构示例\\n\\n```\\nproject.mind:\\n  # @d 实现链表反转函数             ← 可点击跳转到 .py L10 / .c L12\\n  # 要求: 输入头节点返回新头节点\\n  define function reverse_list\\n  input: head\\n  output: reversed head\\n  if head is null return null\\n\\nproject.py:\\n  # @d 实现链表反转函数 ← 可跳回 project.mind L1\\n  def reverse_list(head):\\n      \\\"\\\"\\\"反转单链表\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n      prev = None\\n      curr = head\\n      while curr:\\n          next_node = curr.next\\n          curr.next = prev\\n          prev = curr\\n          curr = next_node\\n      return prev\\n\\nproject.c:\\n  // @d 实现链表反转函数 ← 可跳回 project.mind L1\\n  struct ListNode* reverse_list(struct ListNode* head) {\\n      struct ListNode* prev = NULL;\\n      struct ListNode* curr = head;\\n      while (curr) {\\n          struct ListNode* next = curr->next;\\n          curr->next = prev;\\n          prev = curr;\\n          curr = next;\\n      }\\n      return prev;\\n  }\\n```\\n\\n## 执行步骤\\n\\n| # | 操作 | 复杂度 |\\n|---|------|--------|\\n| 1 | 桥接端: 创建 `codeGenerator.js`（含生成提示词） | **高**（提示词质量决定生成效果） |\\n| 2 | 桥接端: `index.js` 新增 `POST /generate` | 低 |\\n| 3 | 插件端: `bridgeClient.ts` 新增 `generateCode()` | 低 |\\n| 4 | 插件端: 新建 `fileTriplet.ts`（文件发现/创建/映射） | 中 |\\n| 5 | 插件端: 新建 `docLinks.ts`（DocumentLinkProvider） | 中 |\\n| 6 | 插件端: `extension.ts` 集成生成流程 | 中 |\\n| 7 | 编译验证 + 端到端测试 | 低 |\\n\", \"steps\": [{\"id\":\"g-step-1\",\"title\":\"创建 codeGenerator.js\",\"action\":\"编写代码生成引擎：检测 # @d 注释 → 调用 DeepSeek → 解析 Python+C 双语言输出 → 返回结构化结果\",\"risk\":\"high\"},{\"id\":\"g-step-2\",\"title\":\"桥接 POST /generate 端点\",\"action\":\"在 index.js 新增 /generate 路由，复用 analyzeMindContent 的上下文，返回 py/c 双代码块\",\"risk\":\"low\"},{\"id\":\"g-step-3\",\"title\":\"插件 bridgeClient.ts 新增接口\",\"action\":\"添加 generateCode() 函数和 GenerationResult/LinkInfo 接口\",\"risk\":\"low\"},{\"id\":\"g-step-4\",\"title\":\"创建 fileTriplet.ts\",\"action\":\"管理 .mind ↔ .py ↔ .c 三文件关系，发现 .mind 时自动补全另两个文件\",\"risk\":\"med\"},{\"id\":\"g-step-5\",\"title\":\"创建 docLinks.ts\",\"action\":\"DocumentLinkProvider：# @d 注释→跳转函数位置，同时注册 .py/.c 反向链接\",\"risk\":\"med\"},{\"id\":\"g-step-6\",\"title\":\"集成到 extension.ts\",\"action\":\"分析完成后检查 # @d → 触发 generate → 写入文件 → 注册链接\",\"risk\":\"med\"},{\"id\":\"g-step-7\",\"title\":\"编译 + 测试\",\"action\":\"tsc + esbuild 编译，桥接端测试 /generate 端点\",\"risk\":\"low\"}]}"}}],"reasoning_content":"The user confirmed my understanding is correct. Now let me submit a plan for the implementation.\n\nLet me think about the implementation architecture:\n\n### Bridge side changes:\n1. **New endpoint `POST /generate`**:\n   - Input: `{ content: \".mind file content\" }` (same as analyze)\n   - Output: `{ files: { py: { code, map: [...] }, c: { code, map: [...] } } }`\n   - The AI generates both Python and C implementations based on the `# @d` comments in the .mind file\n   - Returns code + position mapping for hyperlinks\n\n2. **New file `src/codeGenerator.js`**:\n   - Contains the system prompt for code generation\n   - Parses the AI response to extract code blocks and position mappings\n\n### Plugin side changes:\n1. **New file `src/fileTriplet.ts`**:\n   - Manages the relationship between .mind, .py, and .c files\n   - Handles file creation/updating\n   - Tracks which functions correspond to which comments\n\n2. **New file `src/docLinks.ts`**:\n   - Registers DocumentLinkProvider for .mind files\n   - Creates clickable links from `# @d` comments to .py/.c implementations\n   - Also registers links from .py/.c back to the .mind comments\n\n3. **Modify `extension.ts`**:\n   - After analysis, detect `# @d` comments\n   - Trigger generation request\n   - Apply generated code to files\n   - Update document links\n\n4. **Modify `bridgeClient.ts`**:\n   - Add `generateCode()` function\n   - Add `GenerationResult` interface\n\nLet me think about this more carefully in terms of implementation details.\n\nFor the bridge `/generate` endpoint:\n- Input: the full .mind file content\n- The AI is instructed to:\n  1. Parse all `# @d` comments and the associated .mind code\n  2. Generate Python implementation with detailed Chinese+English comments\n  3. Generate C implementation with detailed Chinese+English comments\n  4. Return a structured format\n\nFor the response format:\n```json\n{\n  \"files\": {\n    \"py\": {\n      \"code\": \"# Python implementation\\n...\",\n      \"links\": [\n        {\n          \"mindLine\": 3,       // line in .mind file where # @d is\n          \"mindChar\": 0,\n          \"fileLine\": 10,      // line in .py file where function starts\n          \"label\": \"reverse_list\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"c\": {\n      \"code\": \"// C implementation\\n...\",\n      \"links\": [...]\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\nFor the hyperlinks, I'll use VS Code's `DocumentLinkProvider`:\n- It provides `DocumentLink` objects with a range and a target URI\n- When clicked, VS Code navigates to the target\n\nFor links from `.mind` to `.py`/`.c`:\n- The `# @d` comment text gets a link that opens the corresponding file at the function's line number\n- Format: `file:///path/to/project.py#L10`\n\nFor links from `.py`/`.c` back to `.mind`:\n- A comment at the top of each generated function links back to the `# @d` line\n- Format: `file:///path/to/project.mind#L3`\n\nLet me now plan the steps:\n\n1. Bridge: Add codeGenerator.js with generation prompt\n2. Bridge: Add POST /generate endpoint\n3. Plugin: Add fileTriplet.ts for file management\n4. Plugin: Add docLinks.ts for hyperlinks\n5. Plugin: Add generateCode() to bridgeClient.ts\n6. Plugin: Update extension.ts to trigger generation\n7. Build and test\n\nLet me create the plan."}
