ady created)\n3. A batch script that copies the necessary files from the existing directories into the package\n\nOR, even simpler: Create a \"build-package.bat\" that assembles everything.\n\nHmm, let me just use `mklink /J` to link the existing directories into the package. This is the cleanest approach and keeps everything in sync."}
