{"role":"assistant","content":"好问题。先说发布的事。\n\n### 发布到 VS Code 市场\n\n**可以发布**，但需要：\n\n1. 注册 [VS Code Marketplace](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/) 发布者账号\n2. 用微软账号登录 [Azure DevOps](https://aex.dev.azure.com/)\n3. 创建 Personal Access Token\n4. `vsce publish` 一键发布\n\n不过目前插件还是早期版本，建议先在 GitHub 上以 `.vsix` 形式分发，等稳定了再上架市场。\n\n### 改名 \"天阙——轩\"\n\nVS Code Marketplace 的 `publisher` 字段要求**英文小写字母数字**，不支持中文和特殊符号。所以不能直接写成 `天阙——轩`。\n\n建议方案：\n\n| 字段 | 值 |\n|------|-----|\n| `publisher`（技术上必须） | `tianquexuan`（英文） |\n| `displayName`（展示用） | `Mind Language — 天阙——轩` |","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_00_U8ISyTM33lFqfWXoUGPt8498","type":"function","function":{"name":"ask_choice","arguments":"{\"question\": \"publisher 只能用英文（如 tianquexuan）。展示名可以写中文。你选哪个方案？\", \"options\": [{\"id\":\"tianquexuan\",\"title\":\"publisher: tianquexuan, displayName: Mind — 天阙轩\",\"summary\":\"标准和推荐做法\"},{\"id\":\"tianque-xuan\",\"title\":\"publisher: tianque-xuan, displayName 同样中文\",\"summary\":\"带连字符版\"},{\"id\":\"no-change\",\"title\":\"保持现状不改名\",\"summary\":\"保留 mind-lang\"}]}"}}],"reasoning_content":"The user is asking two things:\n\n1. Rename the publisher from \"mind-lang\" to \"天阙——轩\"\n2. Can this extension be published?\n\nFor the publisher rename, I need to change the `publisher` field in `package.json`. But VS Code publisher names need to match what's registered in the VS Code Marketplace. Chinese characters might work but could cause issues. Let me check what publisher names are allowed.\n\nActually, the `publisher` in VS Code extensions must match the publisher name registered on the VS Code Marketplace (https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/). You can't just set it to anything - it needs to be registered.\n\nFor publishing: Yes, the extension CAN be published to the VS Code Marketplace, but it requires:\n1. A Microsoft/DevOps account\n2. Registering a publisher name\n3. Getting a Personal Access Token\n4. Using `vsce publish`\n\nBut the user might be asking about publishing more broadly - maybe to GitHub Releases or as a downloadable .vsix.\n\nLet me:\n1. Change the publisher name\n2. Explain the publishing options\n\nFor the publisher name, Chinese characters in the publisher field might cause issues with `vsce`. Let me use a simplified ASCII version. But the user specifically asked for \"天阙——轩\". Let me use that.\n\nActually, looking at the VS Code marketplace documentation, publisher names must be lowercase alphanumeric. Chinese characters aren't allowed. I need to explain this to the user and suggest alternatives.\n\nLet me suggest:\n- ASCII version: `tianque-xuan` or `tianquexuan`\n- Keep the Chinese name in `displayName` or elsewhere\n\nLet me explain and ask what they prefer."}
